  "contentHtml": "\n<span><span title=\"It's due to those high, wispy clouds that are around today\"></span><span title=\"Those clouds are made of tiny ice crystals, and if the cloud is at the right angle to the sun, the crystals will refract the sunlight (much like a prism) into the colors of the rainbow\"><span><span>Энэхүү\n үүлнүүд өчүүхэн жижигхэн мөс усан болруудаар хийгддэг ба энэхүү үүл нь нартай \nтэгш өнцөгт байна, солонгын өнгүүд нь&nbsp; Призм тэй адил бөгөөд \nнарны гэрэлийн хугарлаар үүсдэг болно.<br><br>Энэ зургуудыг&nbsp; 2001 оны 2 дугаар сарын 28 нд авсан.</span><br></span><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120301084351im_/http://images.bimedia.net/images/080625_rainbow_clouds11.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><br></span></span><span>Камано /Camanо/ арал</span><br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120301084351im_/http://images.bimedia.net/images/080625_rainbow_clouds12.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><br><span><span>Cle Elum</span><br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120301084351im_/http://images.bimedia.net/images/080625_rainbow_clouds2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><br><span>Port Townsend</span><br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120301084351im_/http://images.bimedia.net/images/080625_rainbow_clouds3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><br><span>Мэрисвилл</span><br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120301084351im_/http://images.bimedia.net/images/080625_rainbow_clouds4.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><br><span>Mэрисвилл</span><br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120301084351im_/http://images.bimedia.net/images/080625_rainbow_clouds5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><br><span><span>Камано /Camanо/ арал</span><br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120301084351im_/http://images.bimedia.net/images/080625_rainbow_clouds6.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"a